#   - Master Reset clears IER/IIR/LCR/MCR/FCR; sets LSR to 0x60; sets outputs to inact
#   - After reset, FIFO is disabled (16450 mode) until FCR.0 is set.
#   - Baud rate divisor must be in range 1..65535 (DLM:DLL).
